<html><head><style type="text/css">
.portalButton {
  display: inline-block;
  vertical-align: middle;
  padding: 14px 30px;
  border-radius: 999px;
  background: #0082cb;
  font: normal normal bold 16px Arial, sans-serif;
  line-height: 20px;
  color: #ffffff !important;
  text-decoration: none;
}
</style></head>
<body style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#1f2937;">
<p>Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>
<p>Thank you for sending that over. I've had a look at what you uploaded for:</p>
<p><strong>{{{Lead_Document_Request__c.Subject__c}}}</strong></p>
<p>To move this one forward, there's a little more I need from you:</p>
<p style="background:#f7f9fc;border-left:4px solid #ffa534;border-radius:6px;padding:14px 18px;margin:16px 0;">{{{Lead_Document_Request__c.Rejection_Notes__c}}}</p>
<p>Whenever you have a moment, you can add it in the same place you uploaded the first one. Everything you have already sent is still there, so there's no need to upload anything twice.</p>
<p>Here's the link to your secure portal:</p>
<p><a class="portalButton" href="">Upload Files</a></p>
</body></html>
